    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University Hospital (AKUH) has made history by becoming the first private hospital in Pakistan to perform Transcatheter Aortic Valve Implantation (TAVI), a revolutionary, minimally invasive procedure offering new hope to patients who are not candidates for traditional open-heart surgery. This milestone reflects AKU's commitment to adopting cutting-edge medical technology to improve patient outcomes in Pakistan and the wider region.",
